@startuml
title Weather Monitoring System State Diagram

[*] --> Register

state "Register" as Register
Register : entry / start state
Register : do / create an account
Register : exit / registration success or failure

state Login <<choice>>
Login --> ValidLogin : [valid]
Login --> InvalidLogin : [invalid]

state "Valid Login" as ValidLogin
ValidLogin : entry / user logs in successfully
ValidLogin : do / check weather for location
ValidLogin : exit / transition to CheckWeather

state "Invalid Login" as InvalidLogin
InvalidLogin : entry / login failure
InvalidLogin : do / retry or end process
InvalidLogin : exit / end process

state "Check Weather" as CheckWeather
CheckWeather : entry / user checks weather for location
CheckWeather : do / validate location and show weather details
CheckWeather : exit / transition to ViewDetails or EndSession

state "End Session" as EndSession
EndSession : entry / user logs out
EndSession : do / end the session
EndSession : exit / final state

state "View Details" as ViewDetails <<choice>>
ViewDetails --> Alerts : [alerts]
ViewDetails --> WeeklyAnalysis : [weekly analysis]
ViewDetails --> FuturePrediction : [future prediction]
ViewDetails --> Graph : [graph]

state Alerts
Alerts : entry / show weather alerts
Alerts : do / display alerts
Alerts : exit / transition to EndSession

state WeeklyAnalysis
WeeklyAnalysis : entry / show weekly analysis
WeeklyAnalysis : do / display weekly analysis
WeeklyAnalysis : exit / transition to EndSession

state FuturePrediction
FuturePrediction : entry / show future prediction
FuturePrediction : do / display future prediction
FuturePrediction : exit / transition to EndSession

state Graph
Graph : entry / show graph
Graph : do / display graph
Graph : exit / transition to EndSession

CheckWeather --> ViewDetails : [select details]
ViewDetails --> EndSession : [end session]

Register --> InvalidLogin
InvalidLogin --> [*]

@enduml
